    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d575-a2">

                <pb facs="0959" n="889" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg889"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 298.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Dufferin to Mr.
                            Heap.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Therapia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 5,
                        1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that I have
                    received a telegram from Her; Majesty’s consul at Erzroom, stating that the
                    governor-general at Bitlis has presented four men for Mr. Knapp’s
                    identification, and that he recognized a certain Moussa Bey as one of those who
                    attacked him in May last.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>DUFFERIN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
